---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon";
---

<Layout
  title="Muhammad Rifqi Al Furqon | Senior Site Reliability Engineer"
  compact
>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="home-title"
    class="grid w-full content-start grid-cols-1 gap-8 font-sans text-gray-300 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:gap-10"
  >
    <div class="flex min-w-0 max-w-prose flex-col gap-5">
      <h1
        id="home-title"
        class="text-3xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl"
      >
        I'm curious about why systems fail and how to keep them running.
      </h1>

      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Lately, I've been exploring <a
          href="https://kubernetes.io/"
          class="border-b border-gray-600 text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-gray-300 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
          ><Icon
            name="kubernetes"
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="mr-1 inline h-4 w-4 fill-gray-400"
          />Kubernetes</a
        > and <a
          href="https://nixos.org/"
          class="border-b border-gray-600 text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-gray-300 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
          ><Icon
            name="nixos"
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="mr-1 inline h-4 w-4 fill-gray-400"
          />Nix</a
        >, alongside Linux and cloud-native systems.
      </p>

      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        I started out in data engineering and machine-learning research. These
        days, I work as a Senior Site Reliability Engineer at <a
          href="https://ioh.co.id/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-gray-600 align-middle text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-gray-300 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
          ><img
            src="/ioh-mark.svg"
            alt=""
            width="24"
            height="24"
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="h-5 w-5"
          />Indosat Ooredoo Hutchison</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        I use this site to keep track of what I'm learning and to practice
        writing in English.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside
      class="border-t border-dashed border-neutral-700 pt-5 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pl-6 md:pt-0"
    >
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-200">Start here</h2>
      <nav aria-label="Explore the site" class="grid gap-5">
        <a
          href="/projects"
          class="group flex flex-col gap-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
        >
          <span
            class="w-fit border-b border-gray-500 pb-1 font-mono text-base font-bold text-white transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-white"
            >Things I've built</span
          >
          <span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400"
            >Backend, web, and machine-learning projects, made on my own and with others.</span
          >
        </a>
        <a
          href="/posts"
          class="group flex flex-col gap-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
        >
          <span
            class="w-fit border-b border-gray-500 pb-1 font-mono text-base font-bold text-white transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-white"
            >Notes</span
          >
          <span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400"
            >Systems, tools, and questions I'm still exploring.</span
          >
        </a>
      </nav>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Layout>
